# OpenAI API Compatibility Guidelines

## 🎯 API Endpoints

### Core Endpoints
- **`/v1/chat/completions`** - Chat с streaming
- **`/v1/models`** - Список моделей
- **`/v1/embeddings`** - Text embeddings

### Request Format

```go
type ChatCompletionRequest struct {
    Model            string                 `json:"model" binding:"required"`
    Messages         []ChatMessage          `json:"messages" binding:"required"`
    MaxTokens        *int                   `json:"max_tokens,omitempty"`
    Temperature      *float64               `json:"temperature,omitempty"`
    TopP             *float64               `json:"top_p,omitempty"`
    N                *int                   `json:"n,omitempty"`
    Stream           *bool                  `json:"stream,omitempty"`
    Stop             interface{}            `json:"stop,omitempty"`
    PresencePenalty  *float64               `json:"presence_penalty,omitempty"`
    FrequencyPenalty *float64               `json:"frequency_penalty,omitempty"`
    Tools            []Tool                 `json:"tools,omitempty"`
    ToolChoice       interface{}            `json:"tool_choice,omitempty"`
    User             *string                `json:"user,omitempty"`
}
```

### Response Format

```go
type ChatCompletionResponse struct {
    ID      string                 `json:"id"`
    Object  string                 `json:"object"`
    Created int64                  `json:"created"`
    Model   string                 `json:"model"`
    Choices []ChatCompletionChoice `json:"choices"`
    Usage   ChatCompletionUsage    `json:"usage"`
}
```

### Error Format

```go
const (
    ErrorTypeInvalidRequest    = "invalid_request_error"
    ErrorTypeAuthentication    = "authentication_error"
    ErrorTypePermission        = "permission_error"
    ErrorTypeNotFound          = "not_found_error"
    ErrorTypeRateLimit         = "rate_limit_exceeded"
    ErrorTypeServerError       = "server_error"
)
```

## 🔄 Provider Architecture

### Provider Interface (internal/providers/provider.go)

```go
type Provider interface {
    GetName() string
    GetType() models.ModelProviderType
    HealthCheck(ctx context.Context) error
    ListModels(ctx context.Context) ([]*ProviderModel, error)
    GetModelInfo(ctx context.Context, modelID string) (*ProviderModel, error)
}

type ProviderModel struct {
    ID             string
    Name           string
    Capabilities   []models.ModelCapability
    Parameters     map[string]interface{}
    RequiresGPU    bool
    MinVRAMGB      *int
    ContextLength  *int
    Description    string
    Tags           []string
    ProviderMeta   map[string]interface{}
}
```

### Provider Manager (internal/providers/manager.go)

```go
type ProviderManager struct {
    db        storage.Database
    logger    *logrus.Logger
    providers map[string]Provider // provider_id -> Provider
    mu        sync.RWMutex
}

// Providers загружаются из PostgreSQL при старте
func (pm *ProviderManager) LoadProvidersFromDB(ctx context.Context) error {
    providerConfigs, _ := pm.db.ListModelProviders(ctx, true)
    
    for _, config := range providerConfigs {
        switch config.ProviderType {
        case models.ProviderTypeOllama:
            provider = NewOllamaProvider(config.Name, config.BaseURL)
        case models.ProviderTypeVLLM:
            provider = NewVLLMProvider(config.Name, config.BaseURL)
        }
        pm.RegisterProvider(config.ID, provider)
    }
}

// Периодические health checks
func (pm *ProviderManager) RunHealthCheckLoop(ctx context.Context, interval time.Duration)

// Автоматическое обнаружение моделей
func (pm *ProviderManager) DiscoverModels(ctx context.Context) (int, error)
```

## 🐳 Inference Service (Docker-based)

### Supported Providers (internal/inference/)

| Provider | Docker Image | Use Case |
|----------|--------------|----------|
| vLLM | `vllm/vllm-openai` | Production inference |
| SGLang | `lmsysorg/sglang` | Fast inference |
| TGI | `ghcr.io/huggingface/text-generation-inference` | HuggingFace models |
| TEI | `ghcr.io/huggingface/text-embeddings-inference` | Embeddings |
| llama.cpp | `ghcr.io/ggerganov/llama.cpp` | GGUF models |
| TensorRT-LLM | Custom | NVIDIA GPUs |

### Model Lifecycle

```go
// internal/inference/service.go
type Service struct {
    orch           *Orchestrator
    runtime        ContainerRuntime
    downloader     *ModelDownloader
    registry       *SpecRegistry
}

// LoadAndStart downloads model and starts container
func (s *Service) LoadAndStart(ctx context.Context, spec ModelSpec) (*ModelInstance, error)

// Stop stops container
func (s *Service) Stop(ctx context.Context, alias string) error

// ListModels returns running models
func (s *Service) ListModels() []*ModelInstance
```

### ModelSpec

```go
type ModelSpec struct {
    Alias         string           // "my-llama3"
    Provider      ProviderType     // vllm, sglang, tgi, llama.cpp
    HFRepo        string           // "meta-llama/Llama-3.2-8B-Instruct"
    HFFile        string           // For GGUF: specific file name
    GGUFURL       string           // Direct URL to GGUF
    LocalPath     string           // Path to local model
    Format        ModelFormat      // safetensors, gguf
    Capabilities  []ModelCapability
    GPULayers     int
    CtxSize       int
    FlashAttn     bool
}
```

## 📡 Streaming (SSE)

```go
func (h *Handler) streamResponse(w http.ResponseWriter, req ChatRequest) {
    w.Header().Set("Content-Type", "text/event-stream")
    w.Header().Set("Cache-Control", "no-cache")
    w.Header().Set("Connection", "keep-alive")
    
    flusher := w.(http.Flusher)
    
    for chunk := range stream {
        data := ChatCompletionResponse{
            Object:  "chat.completion.chunk",
            Choices: []ChatCompletionChoice{{
                Delta: &ChatMessage{Content: chunk.Content},
            }},
        }
        fmt.Fprintf(w, "data: %s\n\n", toJSON(data))
        flusher.Flush()
    }
    
    fmt.Fprintf(w, "data: [DONE]\n\n")
}
```

## 🔑 Authentication

```go
func extractAPIKey(r *http.Request) string {
    // Authorization: Bearer <token>
    auth := r.Header.Get("Authorization")
    if strings.HasPrefix(auth, "Bearer ") {
        return strings.TrimPrefix(auth, "Bearer ")
    }
    return r.Header.Get("X-API-Key")
}
```

## ⚙️ Configuration

```yaml
# configs/dev.yaml
inference:
  docker:
    enabled: true
    hf_cache_dir: "./data/models/hf"
    gguf_dir: "./data/models/gguf"
    trt_engines_dir: "./data/engines/trt"
    max_running_models: 2
    default_provider: "vllm"  # vllm | sglang | tgi | llama.cpp | tensorrt-llm
    health_check_timeout: "60s"
    startup_timeout: "5m"
    max_concurrent_downloads: 2
```

